1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:01,231
One selfie.

2
00:00:01,231 --> 00:00:03,081
A whole skincare routine, and a

3
00:00:03,081 --> 00:00:05,050
lipstick you've already tried on.

4
00:00:05,050 --> 00:00:08,823
This is SkinCart, built on the YouCam AI APIs.

5
00:00:09,350 --> 00:00:12,100
Shoppers can't tell what actually suits their skin.

6
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:14,526
So they message the shop, and the owner

7
00:00:14,526 --> 00:00:16,765
guesses by hand, one chat at a time.

8
00:00:16,850 --> 00:00:18,258
This is the live app.

9
00:00:18,258 --> 00:00:19,622
One tap on the sample

10
00:00:19,622 --> 00:00:21,765
photo, a licensed stock portrait.

11
00:00:21,765 --> 00:00:23,652
It goes up to the YouCam File

12
00:00:23,652 --> 00:00:26,059
API, and straight into Skin Analysis.

13
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:29,662
Under six seconds later: twelve real scores.

14
00:00:29,662 --> 00:00:32,805
A skin score of eighty-four, with three focus

15
00:00:32,805 --> 00:00:36,017
areas: visible pores, dryness, and puffy eyes.

16
00:00:36,650 --> 00:00:38,867
Every concern gets a score, and these

17
00:00:38,867 --> 00:00:41,923
overlays come straight from YouCam, showing exactly

18
00:00:41,923 --> 00:00:43,301
where it sees each one.

19
00:00:43,850 --> 00:00:46,843
Each focus area maps to the shop's own catalog.

20
00:00:46,843 --> 00:00:50,142
One product per step, always with SPF.

21
00:00:50,850 --> 00:00:52,536
Now the fun part.

22
00:00:52,536 --> 00:00:55,667
Pick a lipstick, and YouCam Makeup VTO renders it

23
00:00:55,667 --> 00:00:58,543
on the same photo, reusing the uploaded file.

24
00:00:58,543 --> 00:01:00,591
That's a real ten-second render.

25
00:01:00,591 --> 00:01:03,288
Drag to compare, before and after.

26
00:01:06,650 --> 00:01:09,655
Switch to the coral gloss, and it renders again.

27
00:01:09,655 --> 00:01:12,016
Every shade you try lands in the basket.

28
00:01:14,350 --> 00:01:15,284
Happy with it?

29
00:01:15,284 --> 00:01:18,258
Name, phone or email, and place the order.

30
00:01:18,258 --> 00:01:20,252
These are test details.

31
00:01:20,252 --> 00:01:22,981
The basket becomes a scored lead, with the skin

32
00:01:22,981 --> 00:01:26,117
profile attached, straight into the shop's lead inbox.

33
00:01:26,717 --> 00:01:28,125
Using your own selfie?

34
00:01:28,125 --> 00:01:29,572
YouCam needs the face to

35
00:01:29,572 --> 00:01:30,960
fill most of the frame.

36
00:01:30,960 --> 00:01:33,440
So SkinCart lets you zoom and frame it

37
00:01:33,440 --> 00:01:35,856
first, before a single call is spent.

38
00:01:36,617 --> 00:01:38,766
Under the hood, it's three YouCam calls.

39
00:01:38,766 --> 00:01:40,885
The File API uploads the photo

40
00:01:40,885 --> 00:01:42,793
once and returns a file ID.

41
00:01:42,793 --> 00:01:45,658
A Skin Analysis task scores twelve concerns,

42
00:01:45,658 --> 00:01:47,481
and we poll until it's done.

43
00:01:47,481 --> 00:01:50,143
Then Makeup VTO tasks reuse that same

44
00:01:50,143 --> 00:01:52,805
file ID, so there's no second upload.

45
00:01:52,805 --> 00:01:54,749
And results are cached per image.

46
00:01:55,817 --> 00:01:56,831
SkinCart.

47
00:01:56,831 --> 00:01:59,111
Selfie in, basket out.

48
00:01:59,111 --> 00:02:02,584
Try it live at skincart-youcam dot vercel dot app.
